& [Why]
  + lexical lookup is usable but explicitly non-authoritative
  + the existing exact scanner already owns mandatory semantic eligibility gates
  + composing validated artifacts closes the gap with less semantic risk than injecting a lexical channel into scanner internals

& [Solution]
  + add one strict wrapper form compiler validator digest and focused fixtures in semantic_anchor_catalogue
  + require complete seed equality exact-identity-only scanning whole account and replay
  + retain all prior APIs and executable surfaces byte-stable

& [NonClaims]
  + no semantic winner truth permission safety execution persistence provider or effect claim
